@startuml
|Student|
start
:Access leaderboard page;

|LeaderboardInterface|
:Request leaderboard data;

|LeaderboardController|
:Fetch leaderboard data;

|LeaderboardInterface|
:Display leaderboard with points, badges, and marks;

|Student|
:Apply sorting (by points, badges, marks);
:Apply filtering (by batch, group, individual);

|LeaderboardInterface|
:Display sorted and filtered leaderboard data;

|LeaderboardController|
:Check for updates;
:Update leaderboard data;

|LeaderboardInterface|
:Display refreshed leaderboard;

stop
@enduml